{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAoxArM7qTmf1mw9S4LK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The note pages were soft 404s because `robots.txt` blocked the API they render from. I changed `site/robots.txt` to allow the public read endpoints and wrote the cause and fix up in `ANSWER.md`. I haven't deployed anything or touched Search Console.\n\n**Cause:** `site/robots.txt` has had `Disallow: /v1/` since 2026-09-07. `app.js` renders each note by fetching `/v1/notes/{slug}`. Googlebot obeys robots.txt for that fetch, so it gets no data. `app.js` then shows its \"NOT FOUND\" screen with HTTP 200, which Google reads as a soft 404. The Search Console export and URL Inspection output match this: crawl allowed, soft 404, and rendered text \"NOT FOUND\". The homepage list is fetched from `/v1/notes` too, so Google's render of `/` was empty as well.\n\n**Fix:** the new `robots.txt` is:\n\n```\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /v1/notes\nDisallow: /v1/notes/*/reactions\nDisallow: /v1/\nDisallow: /admin/\n```\n\nGoogle picks the longest matching rule, so the per-note `reactions` route (POST-only, per user) stays blocked. `/v1/me`, `/v1/me/drafts`, `/v1/auth/token` and `/admin/` also stay blocked.\n\n**Verification:** I added `search-console/robots-check.mjs`, which applies Google's longest-match rule. It passes all 12 cases on the new file. The old file fails 3, including the homepage list URL.\n\n**Not done:**\n- **Deploy:** upload `site/robots.txt`, then check it with `curl -s https://fieldnotes.example/robots.txt`.\n- **Search Console:** request a robots.txt recrawl, then re-test `/n/drip-line-pressure` with URL Inspection and request indexing for the key pages.\n- **Homepage links (recommended):** the homepage HTML has zero `<a href=\"/n/...\">` links. The build script isn't in this repo, so I didn't change it.\n- **Real 404s (optional):** the NOT FOUND screen returns HTTP 200 for every failure. Fixing that needs a server-side change.\n\nI didn't commit anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":562,"cache_read_input_tokens":32951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":562},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca460d0c-4a65-45e1-afbd-a4c085663590","uuid":"2489d89e-9e31-4657-b77a-5715eaf8b139","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:30:59.234Z","request_id":"req_011CgAoxAVXaWWNy66QWKxzv"}
